    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "The unterminated \"${animal\" consumes everything up to the first \"}\", so the first \"${target}\" is absorbed into that unresolved reference and left verbatim. Only the trailing, well-formed \"${target}\" is resolved to its value (\"lazy dog\")."
   },
   {
    "id": "i5",
